        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A post-apocalyptic action RPG with bullet-hell elements crafted with AI-driven art and systems to tell a story of survival; a type of modern arcade feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content Length: Approximately 1 hour of single player storyline that feels like a dungeon progression. Re-playable at different difficulties. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future content: speed run leaderboards and tower defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI-assisted art, writing, and design; this project is both experimental and deeply personal. As a military combat veteran, I wanted create something that reflects resilience, loss, and the will to keep moving forward despite what is happening. This game is handcrafted with the help of LLM's and diffusion models to tell a unique story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No game engine. Written primarily in Python with performance-critical systems optimized using Cython. Rendering and game logic leverage Pygame(-ce) and ModernGL ... yes, you can! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 Progression &amp; survival — linear story, collect Echo Shards, attachments, and items to adapt your character and beat the system core. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎥 Cutscenes &amp; story arcs - generated assets and royalty-free music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 AI-assisted design — every sprite and system reflects a mix of human  and AI generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Echoes of Eternity — a project for players who want to explore something raw, personal, and different.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A post-apocalyptic action RPG with bullet-hell elements crafted with AI-driven art and systems to tell a story of survival; a type of modern arcade feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content Length: Approximately 1 hour of single player storyline that feels like a dungeon progression. Re-playable at different difficulties. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future content: speed run leaderboards and tower defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI-assisted art, writing, and design; this project is both experimental and deeply personal. As a military combat veteran, I wanted create something that reflects resilience, loss, and the will to keep moving forward despite what is happening. This game is handcrafted with the help of LLM's and diffusion models to tell a unique story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No game engine. Written primarily in Python with performance-critical systems optimized using Cython. Rendering and game logic leverage Pygame(-ce) and ModernGL ... yes, you can! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 Progression &amp; survival — linear story, collect Echo Shards, attachments, and items to adapt your character and beat the system core. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎥 Cutscenes &amp; story arcs - generated assets and royalty-free music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 AI-assisted design — every sprite and system reflects a mix of human  and AI generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Echoes of Eternity — a project for players who want to explore something raw, personal, and different.</p>",
        "short_description": "Echoes of Eternity is a linear action RPG set after civilization’s fall to AI. With bullet-hell elements, you will fight and uncover a human story of loss and resilience—built with AI-assisted art, code, and design.",
